baco (base centered orthorhombic) for pw base

Force/stress accuracy (2026-10-29)
--------------------------------
Use scf_thr=1e-12 and pw_diag_thr_max=1e-10 to resolve the force sum
consistently with CG, Davidson-subspace and PPCG. The original references
and all comparison tolerances are retained. Controls at scf_thr=1e-14
and pw_diag_thr_max=1e-12 confirm the result. Set pw_diag_nmax=200
so PPCG can reach the tighter residual request; a 50-step control
retains early inner-solver warnings for some cells in this group.
Calibration uses GNU 12.3, OpenMPI 5.0.10, four MPI ranks and one
OpenMP/BLAS thread, with the original structure, cutoff and mixing.
